porque no te dejaré hasta tanto que haya hecho lo que te he dicho.", "words": [[0, 134812], [2, 134971], [5, 135072], [11, 135411], [14, 135691], [18, 135951], [27, 136651], [29, 136931], [32, 137072], [41, 137572], [45, 137751], [51, 137951], [58, 138331], [62, 138491], [69, 139031], [71, 139311], [74, 139431], [82, 139891], [84, 139991], [89, 140191], [97, 141085], [104, 141261], [107, 141441], [110, 141581], [117, 142001], [123, 142181], [129, 142641], [133, 142822], [138, 143001], [144, 143301], [147, 143441], [151, 143561], [154, 143721], [157, 143822]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 144852, "end": 151932, "text": "Y despertó Jacob de su sueño, y dijo: Ciertamente Jehová está en este lugar, y yo no lo sabía.", "words": [[0, 144852], [2, 144976], [11, 145676], [17, 145956], [20, 146376], [23, 146556], [30, 147256], [32, 147336], [38, 148094], [50, 148561], [57, 149061], [62, 149341], [65, 149521], [70, 149701], [77, 150041], [79, 150421], [82, 150601], [85, 150761], [88, 150861]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 152212, "end": 159383, "text": "Y tuvo miedo, y dijo: ¡Cuán terrible es este lugar! No es otra cosa que casa de Dios, y puerta del cielo.", "words": [[0, 152212], [2, 152316], [7, 152536], [14, 153016], [16, 153216], [22, 153946], [28, 154227], [37, 154587], [40, 155067], [45, 155367], [52, 156172], [55, 156309], [58, 156489], [63, 156689], [68, 157049], [72, 157229], [77, 157489], [80, 157689], [86, 157949], [88, 158269], [95, 158629], [99, 158849]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 159663, "end": 169250, "text": "Y se levantó Jacob de mañana, y tomó la piedra que había puesto de cabecera, y la alzó por señal, y derramó aceite encima de ella.", "words": [[0, 159663], [2, 159779], [5, 159899], [13, 160399], [19, 160739], [22, 161039], [30, 161419], [32, 161699], [37, 162059], [40, 162179], [47, 162719], [51, 162859], [57, 163139], [64, 163439], [67, 163719], [77, 164399], [79, 164819], [82, 164999], [87, 165519], [91, 165659], [98, 166319], [100, 166679], [108, 167219], [115, 